---
// v2/src/pages/helix/about.astro - Website 28: Helix (About Native)
import HelixLayout from '../../layouts/HelixLayout.astro';
---

<HelixLayout
  title="About | Helix"
  description="Helix keeps thirty prints in permanent rotation. Nothing is filed and nothing is retired."
  currentPath="/helix/about"
>
  <main>
    <section id="masthead" class="px-[clamp(18px,4vw,46px)] pb-[clamp(56px,12vh,140px)] pt-[clamp(104px,20vh,200px)]">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-12 gap-x-[clamp(10px,1.8vw,26px)]">
        <div class="col-span-12 mb-9 lg:col-span-1 lg:mb-0">
          <span data-reveal="" class="micro-wide inline-block text-ink/30 lg:rotate-180 lg:[writing-mode:vertical-rl]">Volume I — On Looking</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="col-span-12 text-[clamp(38px,7.2vw,104px)] font-medium leading-[0.94] tracking-[-0.035em] lg:col-span-10">
          <span class="block overflow-hidden pb-[0.06em]">
            <span data-reveal="rise-lg" class="block">The archive is a coil,</span>
          </span>
          <span class="block overflow-hidden pb-[0.06em] pl-[8%] text-ink/45 sm:pl-[14%]">
            <span data-reveal="rise-lg" class="block" style="transition-delay:120ms">not a shelf.</span>
          </span>
        </h1>
        <div class="col-span-12 mt-[clamp(36px,7vh,80px)] lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-7">
          <p data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:260ms" class="text-[clamp(14px,1.05vw,16px)] leading-[1.8] text-ink/60">
            Helix keeps thirty prints in permanent rotation. Nothing is filed and nothing is retired: the strand turns, a frame arrives at the centre, and for as long as you hold it there it is the only picture in the room.
          </p>
          <p data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:340ms" class="mt-6 text-[clamp(14px,1.05vw,16px)] leading-[1.8] text-ink/40">
            Everything else is deliberately out of focus. That is not a flourish, it is the argument.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-12 mt-[clamp(48px,10vh,120px)]">
          <div data-reveal="wipe" class="hairline h-px w-full bg-ink/10"></div>
          <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-y-7 pt-6 sm:grid-cols-4">
            <div data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:120ms">
              <dt class="micro-wide text-ink/30">Founded</dt>
              <dd class="mt-3 text-[clamp(15px,1.4vw,19px)] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink/85">Est. 2019</dd>
            </div>
            <div data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:210ms">
              <dt class="micro-wide text-ink/30">Cities</dt>
              <dd class="mt-3 text-[clamp(15px,1.4vw,19px)] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink/85">Thirteen</dd>
            </div>
            <div data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:300ms">
              <dt class="micro-wide text-ink/30">In rotation</dt>
              <dd class="mt-3 text-[clamp(15px,1.4vw,19px)] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink/85">Thirty frames</dd>
            </div>
            <div data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:390ms">
              <dt class="micro-wide text-ink/30">For sale</dt>
              <dd class="mt-3 text-[clamp(15px,1.4vw,19px)] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink/85">Nothing</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="spread" class="px-[clamp(18px,4vw,46px)] pb-[clamp(60px,14vh,180px)]">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-12 items-start gap-x-[clamp(10px,1.8vw,26px)] gap-y-[clamp(40px,8vh,90px)]">
        <figure data-reveal="" class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-7 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-2">
          <div class="relative aspect-[3/4] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[6px] shadow-[0_40px_90px_-40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]">
            <img src="/assets/helix/held-still.jpeg" alt="A figure held still on a misty street, shop windows glowing behind." loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover" />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="micro mt-4 text-ink/35">Held Still — Milan, 2022 · Leica M6</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="col-span-12 self-center lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-8">
          <h2 data-reveal="" class="text-[clamp(22px,2.6vw,36px)] font-medium leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]">
            It began as a shoebox that nobody could keep shut.
          </h2>
          <p data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:140ms" class="mt-7 text-[clamp(14px,1.05vw,16px)] leading-[1.8] text-ink/55">
            Four photographers, one box of prints, and an argument that ran for most of a winter: which frames deserved the wall. We never settled it. Instead we hung them on a wire and let the wire turn.
          </p>
          <p data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:220ms" class="mt-5 text-[clamp(14px,1.05vw,16px)] leading-[1.8] text-ink/40">
            The site you are standing in is that wire, wound tighter. Thirty frames, two turns, no end and no beginning worth naming.
          </p>
        </div>
        <blockquote data-reveal="" class="col-span-12 border-l border-ember/40 pl-[clamp(16px,3vw,42px)] lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-2">
          <p class="text-[clamp(21px,3.1vw,42px)] font-medium leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink/90">
            A photograph filed away is a photograph that has stopped working.
          </p>
          <cite class="micro mt-6 block not-italic text-ink/30">From the first wall text, 2019</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <figure data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:120ms" class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 sm:col-start-7 lg:col-span-3 lg:col-start-9 lg:mt-[clamp(40px,9vh,120px)]">
          <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[6px] shadow-[0_40px_90px_-40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]">
            <img src="/assets/helix/long-shadows.jpeg" alt="Two street lamps throwing long shadows across a bright wall." loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover" />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="micro mt-4 text-ink/35">Long Shadows — New York, 2021 · 85mm</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="notes" class="px-[clamp(18px,4vw,46px)] pb-[clamp(60px,14vh,180px)]">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px]">
        <h2 data-reveal="" class="micro-wide mb-[clamp(28px,5vh,56px)] text-ink/30">Working notes</h2>
        <article data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:0ms" class="group grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-[clamp(10px,1.8vw,26px)] gap-y-3 border-t border-ink/10 py-[clamp(22px,4vh,44px)] transition-colors duration-700 hover:border-ink/25 last:border-b">
          <span class="micro col-span-2 pt-1 text-ember/70 sm:col-span-1">01</span>
          <h3 class="col-span-10 text-[clamp(18px,2.1vw,28px)] font-medium leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.02em] transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-1 sm:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4">Rotation over ranking</h3>
          <p class="col-span-12 text-[clamp(14px,1.05vw,16px)] leading-[1.8] text-ink/50 sm:col-span-6 sm:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8">
            There is no best frame and no front page. The strand turns at the same patient rate for all thirty prints, so the picture you meet first is an accident of timing rather than a verdict.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:70ms" class="group grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-[clamp(10px,1.8vw,26px)] gap-y-3 border-t border-ink/10 py-[clamp(22px,4vh,44px)] transition-colors duration-700 hover:border-ink/25 last:border-b">
          <span class="micro col-span-2 pt-1 text-ember/70 sm:col-span-1">02</span>
          <h3 class="col-span-10 text-[clamp(18px,2.1vw,28px)] font-medium leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.02em] transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-1 sm:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4">One picture at a time</h3>
          <p class="col-span-12 text-[clamp(14px,1.05vw,16px)] leading-[1.8] text-ink/50 sm:col-span-6 sm:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8">
            Everything you are not looking at softens, dims and falls back into the fog. Attention is the whole medium here; the coil simply makes it visible.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:140ms" class="group grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-[clamp(10px,1.8vw,26px)] gap-y-3 border-t border-ink/10 py-[clamp(22px,4vh,44px)] transition-colors duration-700 hover:border-ink/25 last:border-b">
          <span class="micro col-span-2 pt-1 text-ember/70 sm:col-span-1">03</span>
          <h3 class="col-span-10 text-[clamp(18px,2.1vw,28px)] font-medium leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.02em] transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-1 sm:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4">Prints, not files</h3>
          <p class="col-span-12 text-[clamp(14px,1.05vw,16px)] leading-[1.8] text-ink/50 sm:col-span-6 sm:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8">
            Each frame is scanned from a physical print, grain and all. What you see on the strand carries the paper it was made on, not the sensor it came from.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:210ms" class="group grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-[clamp(10px,1.8vw,26px)] gap-y-3 border-t border-ink/10 py-[clamp(22px,4vh,44px)] transition-colors duration-700 hover:border-ink/25 last:border-b">
          <span class="micro col-span-2 pt-1 text-ember/70 sm:col-span-1">04</span>
          <h3 class="col-span-10 text-[clamp(18px,2.1vw,28px)] font-medium leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.02em] transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-1 sm:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4">The caption comes last</h3>
          <p class="col-span-12 text-[clamp(14px,1.05vw,16px)] leading-[1.8] text-ink/50 sm:col-span-6 sm:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8">
            A photograph should hold you before it tells you where it was taken. Titles, cities and film stock arrive only once the frame has settled at the centre.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="closing" class="px-[clamp(18px,4vw,46px)] pb-[clamp(60px,12vh,140px)]">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-12 items-end gap-x-[clamp(10px,1.8vw,26px)] gap-y-10">
        <p data-reveal="rise-lg" class="col-span-12 text-[clamp(26px,4.6vw,66px)] font-medium leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.03em] lg:col-span-8">
          The strand is always turning.<span class="text-ink/35"> Send us something worth putting on it.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-3 lg:col-start-10">
          <a data-reveal="" style="transition-delay:160ms" class="group inline-flex items-baseline gap-3 pb-2" href="/helix/contact">
            <span class="micro text-ink transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ember">Write to the archive</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-ink/40 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-ember">→</span>
          </a>
          <div class="hairline mt-1 h-px w-full bg-ink/10"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</HelixLayout>

